WEBVTT

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:06.958
[gasps] Bullseye!

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.083
Poor Jessie. Gotta find a way in.

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:16.082
Buzz. Buzz, where are you going?

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:18.166
Let's talk about this. [groans]

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:19.958
- [electronic wailing]
- Huh?

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:24.332
Uh, what... what is going on?

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:25.624
- State your name.
- [Woody] Whoa, whoa.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.707
- And your purpose.
- Hey, guys. [stammers]

00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:29.542
- Take him in.
- Guys! Whoa!

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:31.166
[groaning]

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.999
- Wait, wait. What's going on?
- [Jimmy Dean snorting]

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.750
[screams] My poncho!

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.249
Quiet, assassin!

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.999
[grunts] Assassin? No, I can't...

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.166
[straining]

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:41.749
- Buzz?
- [all gasp]

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.874
How do you know who we are? Who sent you?

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:46.124
[Woody] Oh, geez! What... I...

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:48.249
- Talk!
- [screams]

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.082
- [snorting]
- Talk about what?

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.166
- What am I supposed to know?
- You bear a holster.

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:55.166
You were positioned outside
our leader's stronghold.

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:56.999
You are an agent of Zurg!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.582
Zurg? No! Hey!

00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:00.166
I don't even know who your leader is!

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:02.707
Liar! You wish to harm
the red-haired maiden

00:01:02.708 --> 00:01:04.207
who bears the mark of Star Command.

00:01:04.208 --> 00:01:05.499
- Jessie.
- [Woody] No.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.249
- Wait!
- [Woody grunting]

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.374
He is not an agent of Zurg.

00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:10.457
[all muttering]

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:11.749
Well, then, who's this old man?

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.832
[stammers] Why do people keep saying that?

00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:14.916
I'm not that old!

00:01:14.917 --> 00:01:17.832
This old man is a toy.

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:19.875
Hmm. A toy?

00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:22.707
Yes. We are all toys!

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:24.332
- Toy...
- [clamoring]

00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:26.874
Our mission on this planet is
to make a child happy.

00:01:26.875 --> 00:01:27.957
I've been dreaming about that.

00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:29.041
You know what I mean?

00:01:29.042 --> 00:01:31.207
- [Buzz] To play!
- To play. Play.

00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:32.374
Hey! Buzz, can you help me...

00:01:32.375 --> 00:01:34.332
[muffled] ...get out
of the mouth of this pig?

00:01:34.333 --> 00:01:37.957
Search your feelings, Buzz.
You know it to be true!

00:01:37.958 --> 00:01:40.582
- [Woody groaning]
- [clamoring]

00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:43.874
And the red-haired maiden
you seek is our toy leader.

00:01:43.875 --> 00:01:45.874
Her name is Sheriff Jessie.

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:46.956
[all] Sheriff Jessie.

00:01:46.957 --> 00:01:50.206
Sheriff Jessie is trapped
inside that stronghold.

00:01:50.207 --> 00:01:52.416
We must infiltrate it and rescue her

00:01:52.417 --> 00:01:53.666
and her trusty steed.

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:55.082
How do you know all this?

00:01:55.707 --> 00:01:58.081
Because I am her deputy.

00:01:58.082 --> 00:01:59.581
[♪ triumphant music playing]

00:01:59.582 --> 00:02:01.041
[all] Star Command.

00:02:01.042 --> 00:02:04.249
Then this old man is a toy?

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.124
[muffled] This pig has bad breath!

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:07.291
Oh, yeah, him.

00:02:07.292 --> 00:02:09.416
He's my sidekick. You can untie him.

00:02:09.417 --> 00:02:13.331
And by the way, everybody,
Zurg is our dad.

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:16.500
- [all] No! No! [sobbing]
- Yeah.

00:02:18.707 --> 00:02:20.707
[♪ adventurous music playing]

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:25.457
Hey. What's on your mind?

00:02:25.957 --> 00:02:26.956
[Blaze] I don't know.

00:02:26.957 --> 00:02:28.666
I just hope that girl's okay.

00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:31.291
[Blaze's mom] Aw. She'll be fine, sweetie.

00:02:31.292 --> 00:02:32.499
- Don't you worry.
- [door opens]

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.749
Hey, guys! Is anyone hungry?

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.166
- [Blaze] Me, me!
- [Blaze's mom] Starving!

00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:37.831
[Blaze] Can we get Pasta Prairie, Baba?

00:02:37.832 --> 00:02:40.375
[Blaze's dad] Ooh, I like
the way you think, <i>anushikes</i>.

00:02:42.582 --> 00:02:44.792
- [panting]
- Spread out.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.625
Not here.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.416
Not here.

00:02:48.417 --> 00:02:49.542
Definitely not here.

00:02:50.332 --> 00:02:51.916
Blast! Where could she be?

00:02:51.917 --> 00:02:54.416
Commander! We found
these electronic devices.

00:02:54.417 --> 00:02:57.541
Hey, Micro-Chippendales!
Hands off. [groans]

00:02:57.542 --> 00:02:59.331
- [chimes]
- Whoa!

00:02:59.332 --> 00:03:01.374
I'm getting a major signal
from all you dudes.

00:03:01.375 --> 00:03:04.249
- I've got full bars.
- Me too. I can map for miles!

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.166
These guys are their own hot spot.

00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:07.624
[beeping]

00:03:07.625 --> 00:03:08.956
Oh, no. They're one of them.

00:03:08.957 --> 00:03:11.749
They're one of us! Nice.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.249
Hey, uh, this one's broken, by the way.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.041
Where are you hiding Jessie, you machine?

00:03:15.042 --> 00:03:16.624
Hey, hey. Easy there.

00:03:16.625 --> 00:03:18.249
- Yeah!
- We're Jessie's friends!

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.791
And I have a name. It's Smarty Pants.

00:03:20.792 --> 00:03:22.041
Hygiene instructor.

00:03:22.042 --> 00:03:23.249
He'll wipe your--

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.332
This is serious, Mr. Pants.

00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:27.291
It is my sworn duty as a Space Ranger--

00:03:27.292 --> 00:03:29.416
- Ha, ha, you said "doody."
- Why, you!

00:03:29.417 --> 00:03:31.124
Clearly, we're all friends with Jessie,

00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:32.999
so can you just tell us where she is?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.499
She went to the tire-swing hill!

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:35.916
It's at the far end of the ranch.

00:03:35.917 --> 00:03:37.457
Gonna take me forever to waddle there.

00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:39.417
Well, we'll need a way to get there.

00:03:40.125 --> 00:03:41.332
[Buzz Lightyears] Commander Lightyear.

00:03:41.333 --> 00:03:43.416
[♪ uplifting music playing]

00:03:43.417 --> 00:03:44.792
- [gasps]
- Oh, my.

00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:48.833
Whoa.

00:03:58.375 --> 00:04:01.000
Bonnie? Did something happen
with your friends?

00:04:06.458 --> 00:04:07.458
Can you show me?

00:04:09.125 --> 00:04:12.000
You're not in trouble, Bonnie. I promise.

00:04:20.875 --> 00:04:22.083
Oh, sweetie.

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:26.083
You know that you can always
talk with me and Dad, right?

00:04:26.625 --> 00:04:28.416
About anything.

00:04:28.417 --> 00:04:31.708
Because we love you, Bonnie, so much.

00:04:32.625 --> 00:04:35.417
I wouldn't change
a single thing about you.

00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:38.916
And I think a real friend
would feel the same.

00:04:38.917 --> 00:04:40.000
Don't you?

00:04:41.333 --> 00:04:42.416
But how about we take a break

00:04:42.417 --> 00:04:44.542
from the group chat for now. Okay?

00:04:45.208 --> 00:04:46.417
Let's get some ice cream.

00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:49.333
[sobs]

00:04:55.625 --> 00:04:57.291
Trust me, you're gonna love it.

00:04:57.292 --> 00:04:58.457
[chuckling]

00:04:58.458 --> 00:04:59.750
- Cool! [chuckling]
- Sure.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.000
[chuckling continues]

00:05:09.417 --> 00:05:10.875
TRI-COUNTY
DONATION CENTER

00:05:11.417 --> 00:05:14.082
Bonnie, they don't have chocolate chip.

00:05:14.083 --> 00:05:15.750
Come pick another flavor.

00:05:17.042 --> 00:05:19.625
[grunting]

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.167
[panting]

00:05:35.083 --> 00:05:37.332
- [door closes]
- [engine starts]

00:05:37.333 --> 00:05:40.166
- Mom, where's Lilypad?
- [Lilypad panting]

00:05:40.167 --> 00:05:41.958
I'm sorry, Bonnie.

00:05:50.208 --> 00:05:51.500
[creaks]

00:05:59.583 --> 00:06:00.749
[sighs]

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.582
- [♪ suspenseful music plays]
- [grass rustling]

00:06:02.583 --> 00:06:04.041
- [blusters]
- What is it?

00:06:04.042 --> 00:06:05.792
- [♪ triumphant music plays]
- [nickers]

00:06:06.625 --> 00:06:07.624
- [shouts]
- [music ends]

00:06:07.625 --> 00:06:08.957
[grunts] Bullseye.

00:06:08.958 --> 00:06:10.624
You shouldn't have followed me.

00:06:10.625 --> 00:06:13.292
- [nickers]
- Oh, bad horse.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:14.833
[blusters]

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:16.874
[sighs]

00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:20.332
You go back to Blaze's,
Bullseye. You're better off.

00:06:20.333 --> 00:06:22.541
- [♪ somber music plays]
- [whinnies, blusters]

00:06:22.542 --> 00:06:26.041
I'm serious. She'll take good care of you.

00:06:26.042 --> 00:06:27.582
And all those horses...

00:06:27.583 --> 00:06:29.041
[blusters]

00:06:29.042 --> 00:06:30.125
[whinnies]

00:06:31.333 --> 00:06:33.332
[sighs] Bullseye, no.

00:06:33.333 --> 00:06:35.083
I'm not going with you.

00:06:35.583 --> 00:06:37.207
I...

00:06:37.208 --> 00:06:39.374
can't do this again.

00:06:39.375 --> 00:06:40.458
I can't...

00:06:41.625 --> 00:06:43.207
love another kid

00:06:43.208 --> 00:06:45.958
just to find out I never mattered.

00:06:47.667 --> 00:06:48.542
I...

00:06:49.333 --> 00:06:50.958
I can't.

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:55.958
[blusters]

00:06:58.375 --> 00:06:59.625
[♪ uplifting music plays]

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.833
JESSIE WAS HERE

00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:11.583
- [blusters]
- I didn't write that.

00:07:12.417 --> 00:07:13.917
It must have been...

